Package: file
Version: 5.22-r0
Description: File classification tool
 File attempts to classify files depending on their contents and prints a
 description if a match is found.
Section: console/utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: BSD
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: file
Homepage: http://www.darwinsys.com/file/
Depends: libz1 (>= 1.2.8), libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: ftp://ftp.astron.com/pub/file/file-5.22.tar.gz file://debian-742262.patch
